  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Stance. Shadow Step to target foe. For 15 seconds nothing happens. Your attack skills are disabled for 1 second, and your stances and enchantments are disabled for 10 seconds. When this stance ends, you return to your original location.",
      "zhTW": "利用暗影步伐移動至目標敵人處，此態勢時間為 15 秒，當此態勢終止時，你將返回原來的位置。但使用後所有的攻擊技能在 1 秒內無法使用、態勢和加持魔法在 10 秒內無法使用。"
    },
